_playuntildone","next":"@.{Wj?BHB-zGTV[z=DV6","parent":"yu[7W+`S-@y^=ZqKC/Yy","inputs":{"SOUND_MENU":[1,"NgQ5Yz~FPH,%rPQ;+WH~"]},"fields":{},"shadow":false,"topLevel":false},"NgQ5Yz~FPH,%rPQ;+WH~":{"opcode":"sound_sounds_menu","next":null,"parent":"nYvD(}8)Dv`zJ**b!}OW","inputs":{},"fields":{"SOUND_MENU":["27",null]},"shadow":true,"topLevel":false},"@.{Wj?BHB-zGTV[z=DV6":{"opcode":"data_setvariableto","next":"q/g*ib9P+vg]i)nb8N.%","parent":"nYvD(}8)Dv`zJ**b!}OW","inputs":{"VALUE":[1,[10,"Not a part, my sister will do the credits"]]},"fields":{"VARIABLE":["Part",":MvT;sTU)dc.R,ul/N|b"]},"shadow":false,"topLevel":false},"q/g*ib9P+vg]i)nb8N.%":{"opcode":"sound_playuntildone","next":null,"parent":"@.{Wj?BHB-zGTV[z=DV6","inputs":{"SOUND_MENU":[1,"_uZ;=e(A4/8pYHWeQVdr"]},"fields":{},"shadow":false,"topLevel":false},"_uZ;=e(A4/8pYHWeQVdr":{"opcode":"sound_sounds_menu","next":null,"parent":"q/g*ib9P+vg]i)nb8N.%","inputs":{},"fields":{"SOUND_MENU":["NOT A PART! end credits",null]},"shadow":true,"topLevel":false}},"comments":{"O#ml{a8shG+vN@X`h_T@":{"blockId":null,"x":451,"y":133,"width":831,"height":1509,"minimized":false,"text":"Intro- Stormkit is asleep in the nursery, and the words \"Don't Listen, complete Crookedstar Map hosted by Lionbrook2\" appear when the Hameln sounds play.\n\nPart 1- Oakkit paws Stormkit awake and Stormkit pulls a grumpy face. Stormkit and Oakkit points his ears outside. The screen flickers for a moment to Crookedstar in the Dark Forest, then back.\n\nPart 2- They're running for a few moments before spotting Goosefeather. He snarls and they start to run back.\n\nPart 3- The two run for their lives. On the second \"Down left\", Stormkit slips and hits his head on one of the rocks.\n\nPart 4- He gets up, dazed and looks at his muzzle. The camera zooms in on his horrorstruck face. The background looks corrupted and distorted.\n\nPart 5- He runs after Oakkit and lip syncs, \"We don't have much time! You need to-\" But then everything fades to black, and a hazy figure crouches beside him saying \"Where did you gooooo?\"\n\nPart 6- Oakkit appears beside him, shocked and confused. Crookedkit yells, \"You need to get out of here before they-AHHHHHHHH!\" as Mapleshade pounces.\n\nPart 7- Crookedkit is shaking and crying as vines form into Mapleshade behind him.\n\nPart 8- Mapleshade grabs his shoulder and Crookedkit whirls around. His back fur is standing up strait, and his claws slide out.\n\nPart 9- Mapleshade is prancing happily around, lip-syncing, and opens her eyes, which flicker with static.\n\nPart 10- Crookedkit looks at her weirdly and says, \"But Amanda, I thought we were-\" and she interrupts with the \"It's my turn, shut up!\" He quickly says \"Ok\".\n\nPart 11- She lipsincs and, now Crookedpaw, nods the whole way through. This is him making the promise. Then at the \"For my friend who is dear to me\" a little Appledusk forms in her paw.\n\nPart 12- She says \"Let's be quick, no dawdling! Before this tape ends sud-den-ly-\" Then her paw smashes into a tree, squishing Smole Appledusk.\n\nPart 13- Crookedpaw, then Crookedjaw, watching everybody he cares about die and turn to spirits, angrily looking at him and lipsyncing. You can also put cameos of your oc's.\n\nPart 14- Rainflower goes up and says, \"So what, are you blind?\" Then Mosskit says \"Or is something missing?\" Willowbreeze says \"This isn't fair,\" and her and their two kits say together \"It's like you don't listen!\"\n\nPart 15- Crookedjaw, now Crookedstar, is surrounded by all of his fallen friends. He senses Mapleshade and sees her in his puddle of tears. \"Past the static on the screen\" Her figure flickers with static.\n\nPart 16- Crookedstar runs away, crying \"I can't control it, and I just know it!\" He's stopped by Mapleshade who grins creepily.\n\nPart 17- Mapleshade is lipsyncing and says \"Never seen a tape where\" while snapping at him.\n\nPart 18- Mapleshade is fading away and says \"I'm out there somewhere, rotting in the nowhere!\" Then Crookedstar tries to grab her, but she goes away.\n\nPart 19- He tries to think of something, but his mind is a mess. All his memories play out, but all the good cats transform into Mapleshade.\n\nPart 20- Continued part 19\n\nPart 21- He lipsyncs to himself, trying to calm down. He closes his eyes. Mapleshade says \"hm\" and flicks an ear as she hears him nearby.\n\nPart 22- Now, in his mind there are two Crookedstars talking to each other. One is lipsyncing, and wears spectacles. :) He is the inner therapist. (Use the Therapist Crooked reference)\n\nPart 23- Patient Crookedstar is shocked by Mapleshade appearing and talking to him. Therapist Crookedstar and Mapleshade argue to Crookedstar.\n\nPart 24- More arguing, Crookedstar is shrinking into the corner. Focus on him, you only see the shadows of the other two.\n\nPart 25- Side view of Crookedstar, as the two argue even more. Then the voices stop, and the camera zooms out to show us that Therapist Crookedstar has vanished. Mapleshade is grinning.\n\nPart 26- Mapleshade lipsyncs \"Do you even care?\" Then it cuts back to actual Crookedstar, not his brain, and he has caught greencough. (This is later in life.)\n\nPart 27- He struggles and says \"this isn't fair...\" You can now see Mapleshade trying to get out of him, trying to crawl out of his head. They both scream, \"Let me OUT OF HERE!\" and then both spirits rise out. Crookedstar's body collapses.\n\nCredits- Whatever Deerfoot decides to do for it!"}},"currentCostume":0,"costumes":[{"name":"Codeword is tape","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","assetId":"217bbe5ad0d0a68dd1dcef06b9c44129","md5ext":"217bbe5ad0d0a68dd1dcef06b9c44129.png","rotationCenterX":480,"rotationCenterY":360},{"name":"Crookedstar Ref","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","assetId":"792daef4979a0ad38ba518fe0570870d","md5ext":"792daef4979a0ad38ba518fe0570870d.png","rotationCenterX":480,"rotationCenterY":360},{"name":"Mapleshade ref","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","as